    "turn_text": "Oh. Oh, God. Oh my God. I mean, there are so many, right? I mean, I would love to the first piece of legislation that I would love to pass is the Voting Rights Act, the John Lewis Voting Rights Act. Yeah. And I would love to work with either with both Michelle Obama and Oprah Winfrey to get that to happen because Oprah Winfrey brings a lot of resources to the table and she can really gavel nice everyone to support that. But really the first thought that came to my mind also was Leonardo DiCaprio because he's been so strong on the environment and the environment is so important for us here in Florida. And he's been a really strong voice. And so for us to pass another package that would invest in resiliency, that would invest in making sure that companies lower carbon emissions, green energy investments. And I would love to use his voice on that.",
