    "turn_text": "Yeah, what's happening here is unique. I think it's very different from the rest of the country, like I said, because we have been under attack for so long that people are ready for change and they're really organizing. That organization came when we were able to get signatures to put this ballot amendment on the November ballot, which would protect reproductive freedom. And that infrastructure is on the ground ready to go, ready to turn our voters out. This is the year that we can show the country, who we truly are as Floridians. And like I said, we're a diverse state. We don't like government interfering in our freedoms. And I think that's the change maker in this election. And for everyone watching, I need you with me. I need your support, your contributions, your time, your energy. Go to Debbie for Florida.com. also follow me. I'm on all sorts of social media, including TikTok. And",
